column3:
• Prepares a #Nature Spell@, to be cast as the next Ability used:
• #POWER:@ {0}
• #SPECIAL:@ {1}
• #DEFENSE:@ {2}
• Using #CONTEXTUAL ACTION@ will cancel this preparation action

• Prepares an #Arcane Spell@, to be cast as the next Ability used:
• #POWER:@ {0}
• #SPECIAL:@ {1}
• #DEFENSE:@ {2}
• Using #CONTEXTUAL ACTION@ will cancel this preparation action

• Prepares a #Sacred Spell@, to be cast as the next Ability used:
• #POWER:@ {0}
• #SPECIAL:@ {1}
• #DEFENSE:@ {2}
• Using #CONTEXTUAL ACTION@ will cancel this preparation action

• Prepares a #Forbidden Spell@, to be cast as the next Ability used:
• #POWER:@ {0}
• #SPECIAL:@ {1}
• #DEFENSE:@ {2}
• Using #CONTEXTUAL ACTION@ will cancel this preparation action

• Grants access to three forbidden spells, to be cast as the next Ability used:
• #POWER:@ {0}
• #SPECIAL:@ {1}
• #DEFENSE:@ {2}
